[32m+[m[32mdef clean_line(line, segmented):[m
[32m+[m[32m    """[m
[32m+[m[32m    This line cleans a line as follows such that it is ready for process by different components of the code. It returns[m
[32m+[m[32m    the clean line or -1, if the line should be omitted.[m
[32m+[m[32m        1) remove tags and https from the line.[m
[32m+[m[32m        2) Put a | at the begining and end of the line if it isn't already there[m
